# Start one Image to Video task with a given model (AIGC Watermark C2PA rows).
# Starts: the Image to Video Custom page with no photo (first open, or after 「Create another one」).
# Ends: the task list with the new task 「Processing…」. Charges the model's price.
# Picks the first photo at grid position $2 (pixels, e.g. 539 1783 = photo_9_16.jpg in 00PDRa_Testing_Material when
# that album is the picker's current one). Args: $1 = model name exactly as listed, $2 $3 = photo tap x y.
# The model is picked last (KP-083: the picker resets to Kling 4.0). Written 2026-11-23 on 16.9.0 (2611193), SM-A5360.
tap 203 970
wait 2
?tapif Continue
wait 2
tap $2 $3
wait 3
setval etPrompt "The woman smiles and slowly turns her head toward the camera"
hidekb
lbl "Kling 4.0"
wait 2
scrollto "$1"
lbl "$1"
wait 2
expect "$1"
lbl Generate
